---
title: "queue (Compound V2: Governor Bravo)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_state_check: proposalState = state(proposalId)
    q_state_check --> q_not_succeeded: proposalState != Succeeded
    q_not_succeeded --> [*]: revert "proposal can only be queued if it is succeeded"
    q_state_check --> q_calc_eta: proposalState == Succeeded
    q_calc_eta --> q_iter: eta = block.timestamp + timelock.delay()
    q_iter --> q_queue_action: for each action in proposal
    q_queue_action --> q_already_queued: timelock.queuedTransactions(txHash) == true
    q_already_queued --> [*]: revert "identical proposal action already queued at eta"
    q_queue_action --> q_enqueue: not already queued
    q_enqueue --> q_iter: timelock.queueTransaction(target, value, signature, data, eta)
    q_iter --> q_finalize: all actions queued
    q_finalize --> [*]: proposal.eta = eta; emit ProposalQueued(proposalId, eta)

    note right of q_calc_eta
        INV-001: Proposal must be in Succeeded state (majority + quorum reached)
        INV-002: eta = current timestamp + timelock delay (minimum 2 days)
    end note

    note right of q_queue_action
        INV-003: Cannot queue identical actions at same eta (timelock restriction)
        INV-004: Anyone can call queue on a succeeded proposal
    end note
